/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// A closure's captured variables start fresh for every task, even when one
/// worker runs several tasks; the caller's closure is left alone.
act make_counter()
    n | 0
    act bump(x)
        n |= n + x
        return n
    xx
    return bump
xx
counter | make_counter()
say(counter(100))
say(:swarm([1, 2, 3, 4], counter, 1))
say(:swarm([1, 2, 3, 4], counter, 2))
say(counter(1))
